    "structuredContent": {
      "content": "{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/jyqj/codecortex/pulls/195\",\"id\":4805113434,\"node_id\":\"PR_kwDOSnV9Ys8AAAABHmg2Wg\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/pull/195\",\"diff_url\":\"https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/pull/195.diff\",\"patch_url\":\"https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/pull/195.patch\",\"issue_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/jyqj/codecortex/issues/195\",\"number\":195,\"state\":\"open\",\"locked\":false,\"title\":\"Integrate reviewed P8 cold and wide protocols with startup fixes\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"jyqj\",\"id\":174292474,\"node_id\":\"U_kgDOCmN9-g\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174292474?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/jyqj\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"## Why this change is needed\\n\\nThe cold-build and continuous dirty-scale studies currently live on separate reviewed branches. Their shared driver and Rust protocol code need one source that preserves both contracts and can pass the unchanged normal CI before integration into `main`.\\n\\nThis PR integrates the reviewed payload/cell-witness source from #193, the cold protocol from #189, and the explicit wide dirty-plan protocol from #194. The initial merge preserves the non-overlapping donor edits and existing review artifacts. Follow-up repairs address the exact Rust formatter hunk and the two existing Rust modules omitted by the wide build's sparse checkout.\\n\\n## Resulting behavior\\n\\n- Cold samples retain two fresh A/B full builds and all fifteen canonical-table comparisons. The original cold study remains bound to source `044c008c9459cfa61e7701db2eb868342c508a39`, run `37954851017`, attempt 1.\\n- The explicit `scale_wide_dirty_v1` profile uses a 4096/1024 main work plan. The existing `scale_capacity_v1` plan remains 200/1024, and product defaults remain unchanged. Both preserve the separate 8/128 fanout plan, incomplete-build closure, full controls and parity checks.\\n- The wide workflow installs the required rustfmt component and includes the two actual external Rust test modules in its build checkout. Its registered five scales × N30 population, worker deadline, output limit and concurrency remain unchanged.\\n- Existing failure records, old source identities, validators and TODO dependencies remain intact. No original TODO is marked complete here.\\n\\n## Review and verification\\n\\nThe source commit is `58a890857a6b6c2da874491817beb6d561897a9a`. Independent review commit `b39fdd8c858755d1a92c176efc5340907f4a3757` covers 1095 product inputs, 75 BASE differences and 146 validation inputs. Its canonical report is `artifacts/checkpoints/p8-cold-wide-startup-integration-bfcc-20261009/independent-source-review.json`.\\n\\nThis PR head `34dc4e14dc96d077eae6173ab6885370323eff3f` has that review as its sole parent and changes exactly the two source-binding files. The six registry fields and four guard pins were independently checked against the actual source/review and the computed tree.\\n\\nThe original 44 scale-driver and 12 cold-driver Python controls actually passed on the five-file PCW2 projection (`da6289df86dd228e810a63b90f4be03c34b8d21b`), with no skipped tests and unchanged inputs before/after. Those five files are byte-identical in the final source; their execution identity is retained. This is not a claim that the final source's native Rust tests or whole CI have already passed.\\n\\nAn additional CI step was proposed and rejected because the original v15 verifier requires the original CI file. The final source restores that file exactly; neither the verifier nor any test threshold was relaxed.\\n\\n## Open acceptance work\\n\\nThis remains Draft while the final source's actual normal CI and source guards run. The earlier #193 check failed the original warm-index fixture at 556.28 ms against the unchanged 500 ms limit; its failure remains recorded. Both earlier wide startup failures also remain recorded and contributed zero measurements. The repaired wide study is separately bound to `008f1ec0ae16b9b6aff9f20d033b17b2219168f8`, run `37982220020`, attempt 1.\\n\\nThe original G8 full study has accepted 4/150 shards and 41/1500 samples; the cold study's last declared intake is 16/150, of which 10 have published original custody. New successful Actions jobs are still subject to original intake. Populations are not pooled and this PR makes no completed-scale or speed claim.\\n\\nOriginal task ledger: **192 total / 163 done / 29 remaining / 0 newly completed**. At least ten original tasks will be closed only when their existing acceptance criteria and dependency chain are fulfilled.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-09T19:45:39Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-09T20:53:21Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"merged_at\":null,\"merge_commit_sha\":\"dc45064b0bdcbc25f03fb09d9e276f30d7694939\",\"assignees\":[],\"requested_reviewers\":[],\"requested_teams\":[],\"labels\":[],\"milestone\":null,\"draft\":true,\"commits_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/jyqj/codecortex/pulls/195/commits\",\"review_comments_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/jyqj/codecortex/pulls/195/comments\",\"review_comment_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/jyqj/codecortex/pulls/comments{/number}\",\"comments_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/jyqj/codecortex/issues/195/comments\",\"statuses_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/jyqj/codecortex/statuses/34dc4e14dc96d077eae6173ab6885370323eff3f\",\"head\":{\"label\":\"jyqj:task/p8-cold-wide-integration-bfcc-20261009\",\"ref\":\"task/p8-cold-wide-integration-bfcc-20261009\",\"sha\":\"34dc4e14dc96d077eae6173ab6885370323eff3f\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"jyqj\",\"id\":174292474,\"node_id\":\"U_kgDOCmN9-g\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174292474?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/jyqj\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"repo\":{\"id\":1249213794,\"node_id\":\"R_kgDOSnV9Yg\",\"name\":\"codecortex\",\"full_name\":\"jyqj/codecortex\",\"private\":false,\"owner\":{\"login\":\"jyqj\",\"id\":174292474,\"node_id\":\"U_kgDOCmN9-g\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174292474?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/jyqj\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_